Subject: [PATCH 3581/3586] dt-bindings: iommu: rockchip: Add RK3528 IOMMU
 compatible

The VOP IOMMU on RK3528 is compatible with the RK3568 (v2) IOMMU, add a
SoC specific compatible with rockchip,rk3568-iommu as fallback.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/rockchip,iommu.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/rockchip,iommu.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/rockchip,iommu.yaml
index 6ce41d1..cfb88e5 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/rockchip,iommu.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/rockchip,iommu.yaml
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@ properties:
           - rockchip,rk3568-iommu
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - rockchip,rk3528-iommu
               - rockchip,rk3576-iommu
               - rockchip,rk3588-iommu
           - const: rockchip,rk3568-iommu
